Z||000000||superXmotorsports||04-04-2000||09:31 PM||||Any of you west coast / western US people collect coins?  Would anyone be interested in swapping 'P' Philadelphia mint quaters for 'D' Denver ones?  I have a ton of P's, the D's are non-existant here on the east coast.  I'm guessing the same is true on the other side of the USA.  If anyone is interested contact me!  The new gold-tone dollars could be exchanged too.  Thanks!<BR>SXM.||||reg||1
