Z||000003||superXmotorsports||04-05-2000||05:02 PM||||Thanks for the replies guys.  If you can buy coins at the mint it's when they're 1st available.  The hot thing right now is the 100 quarter mint bags ($25 worth of 1 type of state quarter)  They are selling on eBay for $50 - 100 each.  I paid big $$ for a couple 'D' rolls.  If either of you have any interest I'd be glad to buy rolls here and trade you (and pay shipping) for rolls there.  LMK.  Thanks!  SXM.||||reg||1
